# Arty A7-100T / Native AI / GlassBox — root ignore
# Track: rtl, python, docs, contracts (src), web/glassbox (src), services (src),
# tools, constraints, configs, vivado/tcl, tests (tb + tcl + hex),
# results/** STATUS/closeout/json (not sim dumps), releases (text + SHA),
# .cursor/rules + agents, .agents/workflows + handoff + project skills.
# Do not overwrite frozen A0.3 / 01R / 02M / LM-00..06 bits on disk.

